                                                                      BUSINESS QUESTION
Which agents handle the most tickets, and how do their resolution times compare?

                                                                     
                                                                         Query:
SELECT   
assigned_agent,
COUNT(*)total_tickets,
ROUND(AVG(resolution_time_hrs),2)resolution_time
FROM customer_support
GROUP BY assigned_agent
ORDER BY total_tickets DESC;

                                                                         Finding
Agent 1 handled the highest number of tickets, but despite the workload, her average resolution time was still faster than some agents who handled fewer tickets.


                                                                      Recommendation
Setting clear performance goals for every support agent so everyone knows what is expected. Track important KPIs like ticket volume, resolution time, and customer satisfaction regularly.
This helps managers balance workloads better and identify agents who may need additional support or training.

